    theoryEn: 'Clear, balanced rules across four areas: difficulty level, resolution options, game type, and UI layout.',
    application: 'Mapa com 3 rotas, dificuldade progressiva via DifficultySystem (rampa linear + onda senoidal), upgrades entre ondas e HUD objetiva com barra de vida e contadores visíveis.',
    applicationEn: 'Map with 3 routes, progressive difficulty via DifficultySystem (linear ramp + sine wave), upgrades between waves, and clear HUD with health bar and counters.',
  },
